2:    FORK & SHARE — Home Page Stylesheet
3:    Extends css/style.css using shared design tokens without modifying shared files.
4:    ========================================================================== */
5: 
6: /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
7:    1. Hero Section & Search Bar
